note pvexpect: name, limit, min-seconds binary64, audit passes (0 timed), algorithm,
note faithful, bits, threads, threads-present. pvresult: passes, elapsed bits, raw line,
note environment, build JSON, differing pass, odd, tail flag, expected-prime flag.
